 class=\"kw2918\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">sized_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span>dog<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>dog.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::size</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> returns an integer equal to the size of a range<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(customization point object)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/ssize\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::ssize</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> returns a signed integer equal to the size of a range<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(customization point object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++2